# ─── Docker runtime files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing under data/ is application code: it is the developer's pantry, their
# tokens and their caches. `COPY .` used to bake all of it into the image —
# including data/mealie/docker-compose.yml, which holds the Mealie admin
# password in clear text. Everything mutable is listed here.
data/*.db
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
data/*.db.bak*
data/backups/
data/rate_limits/
data/*.log
data/*.crt
data/*.pem
data/mealie/
data/*_cache.json
data/weather_cache_*.json
data/api_pairing.json
data/bring_token.json
data/bring_catalog.json
data/bring_migrate_ts.json
data/anomaly_dismissed.json
data/ai_usage.json
data/classify_daily.json
data/shopping_spend.json
data/backup_last_ts.json
data/audit_finished_missing.json
data/reported_issue_fps.json

# Shipped on purpose: the deny rules, the directory placeholder and the source
# data of the seasonal feature. Re-included so a future, broader pattern cannot
# silently drop them.
!data/.htaccess
!data/.gitkeep
!data/seasonal_produce_it.json

# ─── Development-only trees that `COPY .` used to drag in ────────────────────
mcp-server/node_modules/
evershelf-kiosk/
screenshots/
todo/
__pycache__/
*.apk

# The MiniLM weights are gitignored: the Dockerfile fetches them itself, so the
# published image and a locally built one finally contain the same files.
assets/vendor/transformers/Xenova/

# releases/ stays in the context: api/index.php `getKioskUpdate()` answers with
# releases/kiosk-version.json. Put your own APK there via a bind mount — *.apk is
# ignored on purpose, so an image never carries one of your local builds.

# ─── Config (mounted as volume) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.env

# ─── Git ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore

# ─── Docs (not needed in container) ──────────────────────────────────────────
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
SECURITY.md
LICENSE
TODO.md
docs/
*.md

# ─── IDE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
